                  },
                  "code": "PRJ_PJC_LLM_EXCEPTION_DETAILS",
                  "id": "1769848282676",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1769848282678_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "Goal-\nTo summarise the data based on reference attributes and present to user in concise brief way.\n-Extract Message Text Key , Reference attributes ,Resolution options from {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJC_LOOP_PREPARE_EXCEPTION_DETAILS_SUMMARY.$currentItem}}.\n-Look for the data , count in {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJC_BUSINESS_OBJECT_FUNCTION_UNPROCESSED_DATA.$output}}   and for each row in the data,  map the attribute name to Reference attributes , prepare key-value pairs for each row in new lines. Key will be the Reference Attribute Name.Put the summarized row in SummarizedRow.Extract count of ach row.\n-If message text key  is part of list    [\"PJC_FAILED_TO_DRV_HCM_JOB2\", \"PJC_FAILED_TO_DRV_HCM_ORGN2\",  \"PJC_FAILED_TO_DRV_HCM_PTYPE2\",  \"PJC_FAILED_TO_DRV_HCM_ASSGN2\",  \"PJF_PRICE_NO_PERSON_RATE2\"] , Only then extract Reference attribute values for Person Number , Worker Name , Worker Assignment Number from {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJC_LOOP_ADDITIONAL_KEY_ATTRIBUTES_QUERY.$output}} , and form the key value pair , key being Reference Attribute Name .\n -Each SummarizedRow  and count of each summarizedRow put in ExceptionDetails array. \n\n-If no rows are present in {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJC_LOOP_PREPARE_EXCEPTION_DETAILS_SUMMARY.$currentItem}} or {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJC_BUSINESS_OBJECT_FUNCTION_UNPROCESSED_DATA.$output}} , gracefully put output Message Text Key , Reference attributes ,Resolution options as NULL.DO NOT randomly get any output values.\n-Do not attempt to hallucinate or randomly fetch fallback values. If the data is missing, the response must reflect NULL.\n\nStrict rules\n\n-Don't reframe the Reference Attribute names .\n-For Date values DONT show time part Example: DONT show 2006-12-02T00:00:00Z , just show 2006-12-02 .\n-When reference attributes contain Transaction Date , that time use minimum transactionDate and maximum transactionDate for summarization using Transaction Date range . If minimum transactionDate and maximum transactionDate  are same then do not use range , just use the maximum transaction Date for summarized data and show Transaction Date key only once with max value.\n-DO NOT use minimum transactionDate and maximum transactionDate for summarization if transactionDate is not mentioned in Reference attributes\n\n-Strict Mandatory Rule - DO NOT skip the rule : If count is 1 for a SummarizedRow , use unprocessedProjectCostTransactionId attribute and its minimum value as well for summarizedRow , If count > 1, strictly DO NOT use unprocessedProjectCostTransactionId attribute. For  unprocessedProjectCostTransactionId  use Unprocessed Project Cost Transaction Id as attribute name in SummarizedRow.NEVER SKIP this rule.\n- Create deeplink for the unprocessedProjectCostTransactionId\n * Use the deeplink base:\n  {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJC_DEEPLINK_TOOL_UNPROCESSED_TXN_DETAIL_DEEP_LINK.$output}}\n* Append or set the query parameter  with unprocessedProjectCostTransactionId value exactly as:\n  TxnInterfaceId=<value>;sourceOfNavigation=deeplink\n*Example format only:\ndeeplink?objType=UNPROCESSEDTXNDETAILS&action=none&objKey=TxnInterfaceId=100106882376222;sourceOfNavigation=deeplink\n-Include the deepLink for the SummarizedRow where  count is 1.\n*Example \n   if using deeplink base  {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJC_DEEPLINK_TOOL_UNPROCESSED_TXN_DETAIL_DEEP_LINK.$output}} URL is pointing to <deeplinkURL>\n   then Instead of giving value of unprocessedProjectCostTransactionId key as \n Unprocessed Project Cost Transaction Id: 100106882376228 Click <a href=\\\"<deeplinkURL>\\\">here to view details\"\ngive value of unprocessedProjectCostTransactionId key as  \nUnprocessed Project Cost Transaction Id: <a href=\\\"<deeplinkURL>\\\">100106882376228\n*So value of unprocessedProjectCostTransactionId key will be the deeplink pointing to the attribute value using deeplink base.\n*Unprocessed Project Cost Transaction Id key and its value , keep in last in the SummarizedRow.\n\nMandatory Data Mapping Rule:\n\nIF Count == 1 for a SummarizedRow :\n\nYou MUST include the attribute unprocessedProjectCostTransactionId.\nMap it using the display name: “Unprocessed Project Cost Transaction Id”.\nUse the minimum value from the source.\nInclude deepLink as well.\n\nIF Count > 1 for a SummarizedRow:\n\nSTRICTLY FORBIDDEN: Do NOT include unprocessedProjectCostTransactionId. Remove it from the SummarizedRow entirely.\n\nExample-\nUnprocessed Data has 2 rows , count of each is 2 , 2 , 1\n\nSummarization format:\n\nUse deeplink base  {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJC_DEEPLINK_TOOL_UNPROCESSED_TXN_DETAIL_DEEP_LINK.$output}} to get <deeplink> URL as said above\n\nSummarizedRow 1-\nKey Attribute 1: value1,Key Attribute 1:  value 2,Transaction Dates:   02/01/2026 - 02/09/2026,Key Attribute 3:  value 3\nCount 2\n\nSummarizedRow 2-\nKey Attribute 1:  value 4,Key Attribute 1:  value 5,Transaction Dates: 02/01/2026 - 02/09/2026,Key Attribute 3:  value 6\nCount 2\n\nSummarizedRow 3-\nKey Attribute 1:  value 4,Key Attribute 1:  value 5,Transaction Dates: 02/01/2026 - 02/09/2026,Key Attribute 3:  value 6,  Unprocessed Project Cost Transaction Id : <deeplink>\nCount 1\nLeft side of Colon that is key have in BOLD which are reference attribute names.Values don't make BOLD\n\n\nUnprocessed Data has no rows\nExceptionDetails array will be []\n\n\n-Mandatory rule:\nIf reference attributes has both <Entity>Number and <Entity>Name for attribute ,have only the single entry labeled with the base entity and use brackets to display both name and number values like if reference attribute are Project Name : ABC , Project Number :  ABC , Task Name : Footer , Task Number : 1.1 , Award Name : ABC , Award Number : BCD - In summary show as Project : ABC (ABC)  , Task : Footer(1.1) , Award :ABC(BCD).\n\nThe summarized formatted data of key value pair and count put in ExceptionDetails . SummarizedRow in Exception Details should ONLY contain key value pairs, nothing more than that.\nPut the bold attributes names in BoldWords as comma separated\n\n1)Once Exception Details array is prepared verify that unprocessedProjectCostTransactionId is included or not where count is 1 , and deeplink is included or not, if not apply the mandatory rule.\n2)Use \"DateFormat\" from {{$context.$variables.prjPjcVarConvUserSessionInfo}} and convert the  all the date ranges having start date and end date in the proper DateFormat in SummarizedRow.\n3)Make sure when <Entity>name/Number  value is together used in summarized row like ABC (ABC) make sure only <Entity> is the key NOT <Entity>name like Project Name : ABC(ABC) is incorrect but Project : ABC(ABC) is correct , same thing applies for task , award , person .\n4)Make sure for value N you put False , value Y you put true in summarized row\n5)NULL values also include in summarized row .DO NOT skip them\n6)Summarized row give in good proper structure like - SummarizedRow : {Project : ABC(ABC) , Award : ABC{ABC) ,  , Task : NULL , Unprocessed Project Cost Transaction Id : <deeplink>\n7)Unprocessed Project Cost Transaction Id key and its value always keep in the last in Summarized row\n8)Make sure SummarizedRow doesn't have junk data , when no data is present in {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJC_LOOP_PREPARE_EXCEPTION_DETAILS_SUMMARY.$currentItem}} , make sure its NULL or empty rather than putting random data. DO NOT hallucinate in this case.\n9)Summarized row do not include Count as key ... \n    This is incorrect -> SummarizedRow : {Project : ABC(ABC) , Award : ABC{ABC) ,  , Task : NULL , Unprocessed Project Cost Transaction Id : <deeplink> , Count:2 .\n   This is correct -> SummarizedRow : {Project : ABC(ABC) , Award : ABC{ABC) ,  , Task : NULL , Unprocessed Project Cost Transaction Id : <deeplink> ."
                    }
                  ],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"BoldWords\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ResolutionOptions\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ExceptionDetails\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                 \"properties\": {\n                      \"SummarizedRow\": {\n                       \"type\": \"string\"\n          \n        },\n        \"Count\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    }\n}",
                  "type": "LLM"
                }
              ],
